    <statement><p>Find the equation of the sphere of radius 3 centered at
<m>(3, 3, 2)</m>.</p>
<p>This sphere is given by:
<fillin characters="35" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left(x-3\right)^{2}+\left(y-3\right)^{2}+\left(z-2\right)^{2} = 9</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><m>\left(x-3\right)^{2}+\left(y-3\right)^{2}+\left(z-2\right)^{2} = 9</m>.



